id: pmc-f08u
title: Prefer actual completion time for changelog release windows
description: "Consume the pm-cli completed_at lifecycle primitive so changelog bucketing uses actual work completion before tracker close time, with an explicit fallback to closed_at for legacy items."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
