comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-28T23:14:03.182Z",codex,"Duplicate check: searched every status for completed_at, actual completion, closed_at, and release-window bucketing. pmc-52px owns explicit release pinning but not the new SDK lifecycle timestamp; no canonical item covers this distinct compatibility change. Upstream contract: pm-cli item pm-bwnclq."
  "2026-07-28T23:15:46.196Z",codex,"Evidence: added typed completed_at support and made the canonical timestamp selector prefer completed_at, then closed_at, updated_at, created_at. The regression proves actual-completion precedence and legacy closed_at fallback across release windows. npm run release:check passed with 193/193 tests and zero production vulnerabilities."
  "2026-07-28T23:46:00.104Z",codex,"Review evidence: addressed Greptile documentation drift plus Sourcery and CodeRabbit test findings. npm run release:check passed with 193 tests, typecheck, zero production vulnerabilities, packed-artifact validation, and changelog consistency."
